*.tgz
*.lock
*.swp

# Per-environment Helm values files, kept local-only — this repo is a public bcgov fork
# (not the private bcgov-c), so real secrets (DB passwords, client secrets, S3 keys, etc.)
# can't be committed here. The README explaining the convention IS committed; only the
# actual per-env value files (which contain secrets) are excluded.
values-local/*/
!values-local/README.md

